<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CSN rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSN rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Compania Siderurgica Nacional with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Hillary Kircher Peruzzi and Clicia Morales said in a report that they view CSN as a &quot;turnaround/growth story.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;Recent ownership and management changes appear to be moving the company more quickly in a positive strategic direction,&quot; they said.</p>
</text>
